              "pointer": "",
              "coded_information": [
                "HPGE"
              ],
              "free_text": [
                " The spectra were measured by two gamma",
                "spectrometers assembled on the basis of HPGe",
                "detectors from Canberra and Ortec. The energy",
                "resolution of both spectrometers was 1.9 keV on the",
                "gamma-line at 1332 keV, which accompanies the 60Co",
                "decay. The detection efficiency of the spectrometers",
                "was determined using the standard 152,154Eu and 133Ba",
                "calibration point sources."
              ]
            }
          ],
          "SAMPLE": [
            {
              "pointer": "",
              "coded_information": null,
              "free_text": [
                "To monitor the flow of bremsstrahlung gamma-quanta,",
                "samples of natural metallic tantalum with a thickness",
                "of 15 mu-m and gold with a thickness of 10 mu-m were",
                "used. During irradiation, a target of metallic zinc",
                "of natural isotopic composition with a mass of 570 mg",
                "and dimensions close to the sizes of the monitoring",
                "targets was added to them."
              ]
            }
          ],
